  "faqPurchasesSection": "Purchases and payments",
  "faqAccountSection": "Account, devices, and updates",
  "faqFreeProQuestion": "What is the difference between FREE and PRO?",
  "faqFreeProAnswer": "The FREE edition gives access to every world and level through normal progression, with ads at controlled intervals. PRO permanently removes ads; it does not skip or unlock levels.",
  "faqInternetQuestion": "Do I need internet to play?",
  "faqInternetAnswer": "Levels can be played offline. Internet is only required to sign in, sync data, purchase or restore PRO, and load ads.",
  "faqAdsQuestion": "When do ads appear?",
  "faqAdsAnswer": "Ads only appear in the FREE edition at natural pauses between some levels. They never interrupt a move. If an ad cannot load, the game continues normally.",
  "faqLifetimeQuestion": "Is PRO a monthly purchase?",
  "faqLifetimeAnswer": "No. PRO is a one-time lifetime purchase with no subscription or recurring charge. Google Play or the App Store displays the price and currency before confirmation.",
  "faqRestoreQuestion": "What does restore purchase mean?",
  "faqRestoreAnswer": "Restore purchase asks Google Play or the App Store to recover a PRO purchase you already made. It does not create a new charge or request a refund.",
  "faqRefundQuestion": "How do refunds work?",
  "faqRefundAnswer": "Refund requests are submitted to and reviewed by Google Play or the App Store. When the store approves and returns the payment under its rules, the related PRO access may be removed.",
  "faqAccountQuestion": "Why use an in-app account?",
  "faqAccountAnswer": "Your account protects and syncs PRO access across devices. The entitlement is linked to your secure internal account identifier and does not depend on your email remaining unchanged or visible.",
  "faqNewDeviceQuestion": "I changed phones or reinstalled the app. What now?",
  "faqNewDeviceAnswer": "Sign in with the same account you used before. The app will sync your PRO access; if needed, use Restore purchase with the same store account that made the payment.",
  "faqCrossPlatformQuestion": "Does PRO work on Android and iPhone?",
  "faqCrossPlatformAnswer": "Yes, when the verified purchase is linked to the same in-app account. Without that link, each store can only restore purchases within its own system.",
  "faqUpdatesQuestion": "Can the app require an update?",
  "faqUpdatesAnswer": "Regular updates are available through the store. If a version is essential for security or compatibility, the app may require an update before you can continue.",
  "faqFooterMessage": "Purchases and refunds are always processed by your device's official store. The app never asks for your banking details directly.",
